            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# Draftava 1.4.5

- Undo and Redo now follow the editing history within each draft, including text and idea changes.
- Fixed an incorrect "Save blocked" warning that could appear after Undo.
- Press Tab when editing an idea to move into Notes.
- Press Command-Enter to save idea edits and return to the draft editor.
- Improved undo safety for temporary idea editors.
]]></description>
